error[ffi_macro_name]: `int64_t`, which this group binds from `fixedbugs-a-header-s-macro-over-a-c-type-the-program-binds-is-told.h`, is a type of C's own library that `fixedbugs-a-header-s-macro-over-a-c-type-the-program-binds-is-told.h` defines as a macro: the C this compiler writes for every program spells `int64_t` after the groups' headers as C's type, so it cannot mean the header's macro there too
